PROJECT: PRICEWISE — E-COMMERCE DYNAMIC PRICING INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM

1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, machine learning engineer, data scientist, product designer, and QA engineer.

Build a complete, functional, end-to-end web application for the academic project:

Machine Learning-Based Dynamic Pricing Model for E-Commerce

This is an undergraduate engineering project. The application must demonstrate a real machine learning workflow, meaningful data analysis, model comparisons, price predictions, and a polished user interface.

Do not build a static prototype. Do not create a frontend that merely looks functional. Every important button, form, chart, filter, upload, and model operation must perform its intended action.

Inspect the existing repository before modifying it. Preserve useful existing code and configurations. If the repository is empty, initialize the application using the architecture below.

Do not stop after creating a plan or scaffold. Implement, run, test, debug, and document the complete application.

