Additional lightweight libraries may be used when genuinely necessary.

Required evaluation metrics

Calculate and display:

* Mean Absolute Error (MAE).
* Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE).
* R² score.

All evaluation metrics must be calculated from actual held-out test predictions.

Explicit project exclusions

Do not implement:

* Unauthorized scraping of Amazon or Flipkart.
* Live Amazon or Flipkart pricing integration.
* Fake claims of real-time competitor prices.
* Payment processing.
* Automatic changes to actual marketplace prices.
* Enterprise-scale distributed infrastructure.
* Reinforcement learning or deep learning as replacements for the three required algorithms.

The application must work independently using an uploaded, public, or locally generated dataset.

